{"steam_appid":2254990,"steam_name":"Permafrost","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2254990/311727199/76e8f8aa7f7fa40132a577003e3260d35da7945d/1790929583/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1791187518","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257443663/fcc74cc61c7ee028c1a01221ff663c0b53bdeff3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1791187518","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/dd279ef7ad03b14027c0d89ba91841f079ea3de4/ss_dd279ef7ad03b14027c0d89ba91841f079ea3de4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791608052","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/386e38bf8ddc44c32976e72d9a3851931538a13c/ss_386e38bf8ddc44c32976e72d9a3851931538a13c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791608052","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/d23ff5e310d31d37bf1abe3ff5e07c2de069f491/ss_d23ff5e310d31d37bf1abe3ff5e07c2de069f491.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791608052","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/ee9b319daa4fd4a8886c590809798d1fbe8165e7/ss_ee9b319daa4fd4a8886c590809798d1fbe8165e7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791608052","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/0f03de9a1c48b09b403cbe5913205d72d35ae9fb/ss_0f03de9a1c48b09b403cbe5913205d72d35ae9fb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791608052"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a “Rook”; an engineer with the skills to rebuild, but little wilderness experience, drawn into this frozen, unforgiving world by a radio signal from a long-lost friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a grounded, story-driven open-world survival set in a near-future Earth locked in endless winter after a series of catastrophes that culminated in the shattering of the moon. As a solo player or together with up to 3 friends, explore frozen cities and wilderness, survive brutal weather, navigate faction-controlled territories, hunt, scavenge, craft, and build a network of shelters to endure this post-apocalyptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/a2ca4e14beabc5b3dcb19b6a10624599.webp?t=1791608052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras_big/a2ca4e14beabc5b3dcb19b6a10624599.webp?t=1791608052 width=1560 height=28 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE COLD IS YOUR TRUE ENEMY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/91af9a964b90154263af522d382e4fec.poster.avif?t=1791608052\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/91af9a964b90154263af522d382e4fec.webm?t=1791608052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/91af9a964b90154263af522d382e4fec.mp4?t=1791608052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cold is alive and ever-present. Frostbite, storms, and creeping chill shape every journey, turning preparation, shelter, and timing into matters of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/a2ca4e14beabc5b3dcb19b6a10624599.webp?t=1791608052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras_big/a2ca4e14beabc5b3dcb19b6a10624599.webp?t=1791608052 width=1560 height=28 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A FROZEN OPEN WORLD TO EXPLORE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/9cb5dd5a5ae59a093b031f1bee7e8cea.poster.avif?t=1791608052\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/9cb5dd5a5ae59a093b031f1bee7e8cea.webm?t=1791608052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/9cb5dd5a5ae59a093b031f1bee7e8cea.mp4?t=1791608052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a frozen open world where city ruins fade into wilderness. A tense, grounded survival experience shaped by silence and scarcity - no constant gunfire, no fantasy tropes. Just winter, isolation, and resolve.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/a2ca4e14beabc5b3dcb19b6a10624599.webp?t=1791608052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras_big/a2ca4e14beabc5b3dcb19b6a10624599.webp?t=1791608052 width=1560 height=28 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPLORATION-GATED PROGRESSION!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/38ab03bab3ed26a78f5577fd059f89ec.poster.avif?t=1791608052\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/38ab03bab3ed26a78f5577fd059f89ec.webm?t=1791608052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/38ab03bab3ed26a78f5577fd059f89ec.mp4?t=1791608052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress is earned through exploration and adaptation. Restore abandoned shelters, repair broken machines, and reclaim fragile technology to push deeper into the frozen world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/a2ca4e14beabc5b3dcb19b6a10624599.webp?t=1791608052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras_big/a2ca4e14beabc5b3dcb19b6a10624599.webp?t=1791608052 width=1560 height=28 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>YOUR DOG AS YOUR LOYAL COMPANION!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/b013484865c0bf1eeb5298a765da79e6.poster.avif?t=1791608052\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/b013484865c0bf1eeb5298a765da79e6.webm?t=1791608052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/b013484865c0bf1eeb5298a765da79e6.mp4?t=1791608052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your loyal dog companion stands with you when the cold turns everything else silent. Rescued from the ruins, your dog scouts ahead, warns of danger, carries supplies, and keeps you grounded when the silence gets to be too much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/a2ca4e14beabc5b3dcb19b6a10624599.webp?t=1791608052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras_big/a2ca4e14beabc5b3dcb19b6a10624599.webp?t=1791608052 width=1560 height=28 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SYMBIOTIC 1-4 PLAYER CO-OP SURVIVAL!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/a5ea52b0d0b13236a4749b1617042c39.poster.avif?t=1791608052\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/a5ea52b0d0b13236a4749b1617042c39.webm?t=1791608052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/a5ea52b0d0b13236a4749b1617042c39.mp4?t=1791608052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cold doesn't care how many of you there are. Play solo or survive alongside up to 3 friends, building shelter networks, dividing responsibilities, and playing to each other's strengths. Co-op doesn't simplify the world; it just means you don't face the cold alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2254990/extras/ee26cc727d1756bd6331f7435e9eab3b.avif?t=1791608052\" width=1560 height=250 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (x64)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 8600K or AMD Ryzen 5 3500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060 6GB or AMD Radeon RX 590 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (x64)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12400 or AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 3070 Ti 8GB or AMD Radeon RX 6750 XT 12GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","RPG","Simulation","Early Access"],"developers":["SpaceRocket Games"],"publishers":["Toplitz Productions"],"release_date":"Oct 9, 2026"}